plan.angle:
COMPOSER-FIRST with a derived-trunk recipe v3 and a pure face-rule module, plus one digest-safe planet horn fix. The modular composer the owner saw on the web gets three things:
- a Face selector that includes a real Proboscis (trunk) face;
